@title Commissioning: a failed check is a red triangle on its row and wire, and an open redline a yellow one
@area Commissioning
# T13: Checks tab, open wire 1 and fail its continuity check with a reason. The check row leads with a red triangle, the Punch tab shows the item the failure opened with the same triangle, and the wire is marked on the drawing. On the Redlines tab an open redline gets a yellow triangle.
open_starter_example
wait 20
click_text Commissioning #1
wait 20
click 103 362
wait 10
key f
wait 6
text loose crimp
key Enter
wait 10
shot failed-check
expect "Error: Continuity check failed"
click_text Punch
wait 10
expect "Error: Continuity check failed"
shot punch-same-triangle
click_text Redlines
wait 10
click 170 307
text Cable swapped on the machine
click_text "Add redline"
wait 10
expect "Warning: Machine differs from drawing"
shot open-redline
check_layout
